# Hutao Chevreuse Fischl Beidou. ~20s Rot. Overload Hutao with IR. Hutao does 6N3CJ N2CJ. Hutao & Chevreuse burst every other rotation. Fischl alternates skill and burst. Beidou uses skill once per rotation. 20% Counter, 20% Perfect Counters. 3EM Hutao similar in 2T.

# Team
hutao char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
hutao add weapon="deathmatch" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
